{"title": "Yeenoghu's Gift", "pageid": 28057, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Yeenoghu's_Gift", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeenoghu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yeenoghu's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Yeenoghu\">Yeenoghu's</a></span> Gift</b> is a passive feature which requires the wielder continue attacking or go mad.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Hitting an enemy with this weapon heals the wielder for <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> - but they can go <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\">Mad</a> if they don't continue hitting an enemy each turn.\n</p><p>Healing through this item doesn't trigger other passives that react to healing. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Yeenoghu.27s_Blessing\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Yeenoghu's_Blessing\"> Condition: Yeenoghu's Blessing </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Yeenoghu's Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yeenoghu's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yeenoghu%27s_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Yeenoghu's Blessing (Condition)\">Yeenoghu's Blessing</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Indulged its lust for violence.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_(Passive_Feature)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Yeenoghu's Gift (Passive Feature)\">Yeenoghu's Gift</a> won't turn the affected creature <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\">Mad</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Yeenoghu.27s_Gift\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Yeenoghu's_Gift\"> Condition: Yeenoghu's Gift </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_(Condition)\" title=\"Yeenoghu's Gift (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yeenoghu's Gift\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yeenoghu%27s_Gift_(Condition)\" title=\"Yeenoghu's Gift (Condition)\">Yeenoghu's Gift</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 6  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Famished for slaughter.</li>\n<li>Affected entity can go <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\">Mad</a> for 2 turns if it doesn't deal damage to an enemy by the end of its turn.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Flail\" title=\"Shattered Flail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Flail\" title=\"Shattered Flail\">Shattered Flail</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>After hitting a creature with the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Flail\" title=\"Shattered Flail\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Shattered Flail</span></a>, the wielder gains <b>Yeenoghu's Gift</b> for 6 turns. For the duration, they must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> at the end of any turn on which they do not hit an enemy, or go <b>Mad</b> for 1 turn.\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> rolls made by the wielder of this weapon do not appear in the combat log, but they are in fact being rolled at the end of each turn where the wielder <i>does not damage an enemy</i>.</li>\n<li>The duration of <b>Yeenoghu's Gift</b> is not refreshed by hitting enemies again; it only lasts the base 6 turns, after which it can be re-applied.</li></ul></li>\n<li>While <b>Mad</b>, the wielder is uncontrollably hostile to all nearby creatures, including allies, and uses any and all tools at their disposal to inflict harm. This could include using powerful <a href=\"/wiki/Ammunition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammunition\">Ammunition</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumables</a> from their inventory, casting high level <a href=\"/wiki/Spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell\">Spells</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/30px-Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/40px-Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"shoving\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">shoving</a> allies to their deaths.</li>\n<li>Although the combat log states \"Tav healed self...\", this healing does <i>not</i> trigger other items which activate on the character's healing such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort\" title=\"Boots of Aid and Comfort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort\" title=\"Boots of Aid and Comfort\">Boots of Aid and Comfort</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Whispering_Promise\" title=\"The Whispering Promise\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Whispering_Promise\" title=\"The Whispering Promise\">The Whispering Promise</a> or <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Broodmother%27s_Revenge\" title=\"Broodmother's Revenge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Broodmother%27s_Revenge\" title=\"Broodmother's Revenge\">Broodmother's Revenge</a>.</li>\n<li>The wielder is healed upon <i>each instance of damage</i>. This means that in the case of attacks which deal multiple damage types, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Booming Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\">Booming Blade</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\">Divine Smite</a> (as well as other <a href=\"/wiki/Smite\" title=\"Smite\">Smite</a> spells), or in the case of attacks which damage multiple targets, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\">Slashing Flourish (Melee)</a>, the wielder is healed multiple times.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211204\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4616/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48826/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20077/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.032/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 994156/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   86.654      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   86.654      1 -total\n 27.03%   23.421     10 Template:Icon_text\n 26.98%   23.376     54 Template:Trim\n 26.20%   22.701      9 Template:Icon_link\n 20.61%   17.858      4 Template:Item_icon\n 17.33%   15.019      3 Template:SmRarityItem\n 16.91%   14.649      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.56%   14.346      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.34%   14.162      2 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28057-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211204 and revision id 348598. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}